.TH start-cli-auth-token-create 1  "create "
.SH NAME
start\-cli\-auth\-token\-create \- Create a bearer token that authenticates as a new session
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBstart\-cli auth token create\fR <\fB\-\-name\fR> [\fB\-\-format\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Create a bearer token that authenticates as a new session
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-name\fR \fI<NAME>\fR
Name shown for the token in the session list
.TP
\fB\-\-format\fR

.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
